  "description": "The java-1.8.0-openjdk packages provide the OpenJDK 8 Java Runtime Environment and the OpenJDK 8 Java Software Development Kit.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* JDK: Improve Resource Resolving (CVE-2026-60589)\n\n* JDK: Enhance HTTP Connections (CVE-2026-61308)\n\n* JDK: Enhance TLS server (CVE-2026-70907)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
